From 0d00f79da3117e62db872df360acaa4c30d5a354 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: P4R4D16M4 <patrickheinzelbecker@googlemail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 09:50:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/18] NAS542: platform support for the LS1024A board

Device tree, clocks, reset, SATA, USB, NAND (read-only), GPIO, I2C,
board power-off and the other NAS542 platform changes on top of
Linux 6.6.145.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
